{"version":18,"type":"full","exportedAt":1792006378204,"world":{"id":"WrAObMdV1iWydr79-9UFa","name":"The Cold Choir","description":"A gritty space opera in three eras. A generation ship arrives at a dim red star; three hundred years later its descendants rule by a lie; seven hundred years on, scavengers pick at the bones of both. Under the ice of Ninefold, something is still cold.","coverImageId":null,"theme":"theme-scifi","continuityStaleThreshold":5,"calendar":{"startYear":1,"yearSuffix":"","months":[{"name":"Firstwatch","days":30},{"name":"Ember","days":30},{"name":"Haul","days":30},{"name":"Thaw","days":30},{"name":"Lode","days":30},{"name":"Brine","days":30},{"name":"Midhold","days":30},{"name":"Rust","days":30},{"name":"Ballast","days":30},{"name":"Ashfall","days":30},{"name":"Longdark","days":30},{"name":"Yield","days":30},{"name":"Quiet Days","days":5,"intercalary":true}],"eras":[{"label":"BL","counts":"down","first":1},{"label":"AL","start":2,"counts":"up","first":1}]},"pinsSetClock":true,"createdAt":1791998117049,"updatedAt":1792005530048,"wordTarget":50000,"chapterHeading":"chapter-words-title"},"mapLayers":[{"id":"K5iWEt8U1PyOOet3iDqHG","levelGroupId":null,"levelIndex":0,"levelLabel":"","worldId":"WrAObMdV1iWydr79-9UFa","parentMapId":"hOWCGejN0koMKyMLEcw4x","name":"Mercy of Tolland","description":"Yard drawing 7/C of the generation hauler, longitudinal section. The same hull is the Mercy (0 AL), the core of Tolland Station (311 AL) and the Hulk (742 AL).","imageId":"CLEkVM0Uwp038_adpk_pw","imageWidth":2048,"imageHeight":931,"scalePixelsPerUnit":null,"scaleUnit":null,"createdAt":1791999052813,"updatedAt":1791999052813},{"id":"_He5HO1KES1AkTNXs_Zls","levelGroupId":null,"levelIndex":0,"levelLabel":"","worldId":"WrAObMdV1iWydr79-9UFa","parentMapId":"hOWCGejN0koMKyMLEcw4x","name":"Ninefold \u2014 Gallows Quadrant","description":"Union survey of the Gallows quadrant of the ice moon: the town, Shaft Twelve, Calloway's Rift and the Interdict Field.","imageId":"IW6WpmU-SDY5nDOtY4gqt","imageWidth":1600,"imageHeight":1400,"scalePixelsPerUnit":null,"scaleUnit":null,"createdAt":1791999109275,"updatedAt":1791999109275},{"id":"hOWCGejN0koMKyMLEcw4x","levelGroupId":null,"levelIndex":0,"levelLabel":"","worldId":"WrAObMdV1iWydr79-9UFa","parentMapId":null,"name":"The Cauld Reach","description":"The system the Mercy of Tolland came to: the red dwarf Cauld, the gas giant Hesper and its moons, the Scree. Drawn from the Mercy's own approach charts.","imageId":"l6qKgohcgQmPX79rcH3ET","imageWidth":2000,"imageHeight":1400,"scalePixelsPerUnit":null,"scaleUnit":null,"createdAt":1791998894519,"updatedAt":1791998894519}],"locationMarkers":[{"id":"2J90_-qkHblQ2Hns6HxMi","worldId":"WrAObMdV1iWydr79-9UFa","mapLayerId":"K5iWEt8U1PyOOet3iDqHG","linkedMapLayerId":null,"name":"Engine Deck","description":"The Mercy's fusion drive and reaction-mass tanks.","x":1694.0671140939598,"y":465.61073825503354,"imageId":null,"iconType":"building","tags":[],"factionId":null,"createdAt":1791999200132,"updatedAt":1791999200132,"version":1},{"id":"3UHWEEdv1Nz8fLrFRstqt","worldId":"WrAObMdV1iWydr79-9UFa","mapLayerId":"K5iWEt8U1PyOOet3iDqHG","linkedMapLayerId":null,"name":"Chapel of the Father","description":"A side-chamber off the old medbay where Brother Lio keeps the last candles of the Kesh Faith.","x":883.1140939597316,"y":326.4429530201342,"imageId":null,"iconType":"building","tags":[],"factionId":null,"createdAt":1791999206603,"updatedAt":1791999206603,"version":1},{"id":"4jf9axgqen2qDyUdWny3I","worldId":"WrAObMdV1iWydr79-9UFa","mapLayerId":"K5iWEt8U1PyOOet3iDqHG","linkedMapLayerId":null,"name":"The Spine","description":"The kilometre-long axial corridor of the ship. Under thrust, a tower people learn to climb.","x":651.1677852348994,"y":465.61073825503354,"imageId":null,"iconType":"building","tags":[],"factionId":null,"createdAt":1791999177665,"updatedAt":1791999177665,"version":1},{"id":"7ZNq1_qn7gwW7-y6J3aZ2","worldId":"WrAObMdV1iWydr79-9UFa","mapLayerId":"hOWCGejN0koMKyMLEcw4x","linkedMapLayerId":"_He5HO1KES1AkTNXs_Zls","name":"Ninefold","description":"Ice moon of Hesper, cracked and refrozen like folded paper. Ice mines from the second century AL; the Gallows quadrant holds the town, the shafts and the Interdict Field.","x":1690.2216427640158,"y":1020.3389830508476,"imageId":null,"iconType":"custom","customType":"Moon","tags":[],"factionId":null,"createdAt":1791998956450,"updatedAt":1791999109350,"version":2},{"id":"89HA2nDby4OmDtbn3ECN7","worldId":"WrAObMdV1iWydr79-9UFa","mapLayerId":"K5iWEt8U1PyOOet3iDqHG","linkedMapLayerId":null,"name":"Observation Blister","description":"A glass dome on the bow, the only place on the Mercy with a real window. Lovers, mourners, and officers who want to talk without logs.","x":305.8255033557047,"y":596.1879194630873,"imageId":null,"iconType":"building","tags":[],"factionId":null,"createdAt":1791999168470,"updatedAt":1791999168470,"version":1},{"id":"AHKUmRwJbAFApL8blzIJ2","worldId":"WrAObMdV1iWydr79-9UFa","mapLayerId":"_He5HO1KES1AkTNXs_Zls","linkedMapLayerId":null,"name":"Union Hall","description":"Red-painted hall of the Ninefold Ice Union in Gallows Town.","x":386.9621903520209,"y":861.5384615384615,"imageId":null,"iconType":"building","tags":[],"factionId":null,"createdAt":1791999233002,"updatedAt":1791999233002,"version":1},{"id":"C3FIzj0yf0O3ngZaQIV5H","worldId":"WrAObMdV1iWydr79-9UFa","mapLayerId":"K5iWEt8U1PyOOet3iDqHG","linkedMapLayerId":null,"name":"Medbay","description":"Ship's infirmary. Where Captain Oyelaran died and Sefa Lund kept the numbers.","x":781.744966442953,"y":541.2080536912752,"imageId":null,"iconType":"building","tags":[],"factionId":null,"createdAt":1791999180802,"updatedAt":1791999180802,"version":1},{"id":"ET0r_2FEn_g7_lYmHaQf6","worldId":"WrAObMdV1iWydr79-9UFa","mapLayerId":"K5iWEt8U1PyOOet3iDqHG","linkedMapLayerId":null,"name":"Counting House","description":"Marrow Fane's office on the old bridge deck of the Hulk, 742 AL: ledgers, relics, a bell that no longer rings.","x":213.04697986577182,"y":410.6308724832215,"imageId":null,"iconType":"building","tags":[],"factionId":null,"createdAt":1791999203364,"updatedAt":1791999203364,"version":1},{"id":"FjkJFggKTvQonCgHoICS1","worldId":"WrAObMdV1iWydr79-9UFa","mapLayerId":"K5iWEt8U1PyOOet3iDqHG","linkedMapLayerId":null,"name":"Hall of Muster","description":"Built into the old forward hold in 11 AL. The Compact's archive and ceremonial hall; the Muster Roll is kept here under glass.","x":1042.8993288590605,"y":402.0402684563758,"imageId":null,"iconType":"building","tags":[],"factionId":null,"createdAt":1791999190501,"updatedAt":1791999190501,"version":1},{"id":"GAVYuM30sRMr0QyVo1MsA","worldId":"WrAObMdV1iWydr79-9UFa","mapLayerId":"_He5HO1KES1AkTNXs_Zls","linkedMapLayerId":null,"name":"Calloway's Rift","description":"A long refrozen crack across the quadrant, named for the first Kin family who walked it.","x":428.9439374185137,"y":600.5215123859192,"imageId":null,"iconType":"landmark","tags":[],"factionId":null,"createdAt":1791999245216,"updatedAt":1791999245216,"version":1},{"id":"HbnBXM2OZ-EqHSiiuSTVc","worldId":"WrAObMdV1iWydr79-9UFa","mapLayerId":"K5iWEt8U1PyOOet3iDqHG","linkedMapLayerId":null,"name":"Crew Rings","description":"Two spun habitat rings, A and B, where the waking crew lived for a hundred and ninety years. Spin stopped for the deceleration burn.","x":482.79194630872485,"y":522.3087248322148,"imageId":null,"iconType":"building","tags":[],"factionId":null,"createdAt":1791999171504,"updatedAt":1791999171504,"version":1},{"id":"KEB1yuj8GwIjzG_FwfaPN","worldId":"WrAObMdV1iWydr79-9UFa","mapLayerId":"K5iWEt8U1PyOOet3iDqHG","linkedMapLayerId":null,"name":"Forward Hold","description":"The great cargo hold forward of Deck Nine. Where the crew council met during the burn.","x":986.2013422818792,"y":541.2080536912752,"imageId":null,"iconType":"building","tags":[],"factionId":null,"createdAt":1791999187320,"updatedAt":1791999187320,"version":1},{"id":"LXUXgA4wS1ieLl7SGh-py","worldId":"WrAObMdV1iWydr79-9UFa","mapLayerId":"K5iWEt8U1PyOOet3iDqHG","linkedMapLayerId":null,"name":"Drop Bay","description":"Clamp gallery under Deck Nine. Manual release stations at each corner, sealed since the yard.","x":1359.03355704698,"y":195.86577181208054,"imageId":null,"iconType":"building","tags":[],"factionId":null,"createdAt":1791999196864,"updatedAt":1791999196864,"version":1},{"id":"V6KUDzVSv4lmRZMLasSVx","worldId":"WrAObMdV1iWydr79-9UFa","mapLayerId":"K5iWEt8U1PyOOet3iDqHG","linkedMapLayerId":null,"name":"Kin Quarter","description":"Ring B in the Compact years: Ninefold Kin, miners' families and the poor. Laundry lines across the old corridors.","x":594.4697986577181,"y":353.93288590604027,"imageId":null,"iconType":"building","tags":[],"factionId":null,"createdAt":1791999174520,"updatedAt":1791999174520,"version":1},{"id":"X-RTBLHErhKR9ZtgUT5E5","worldId":"WrAObMdV1iWydr79-9UFa","mapLayerId":"K5iWEt8U1PyOOet3iDqHG","linkedMapLayerId":null,"name":"The Bridge","description":"The Mercy's command deck in the bow. The captain's bell hangs here. In 311 AL it is the Warden-General's residence; in 742 AL Marrow Fane keeps his ledgers in the next compartment.","x":278.33557046979865,"y":484.51006711409394,"imageId":null,"iconType":"building","tags":[],"factionId":null,"createdAt":1791999165389,"updatedAt":1791999165389,"version":1},{"id":"XiG3_An1XCamJg4EQPbxG","worldId":"WrAObMdV1iWydr79-9UFa","mapLayerId":"K5iWEt8U1PyOOet3iDqHG","linkedMapLayerId":null,"name":"Quartermaster's Store","description":"Bram Okafor's stores and the paper Muster Roll. Burned in the troubles before Landfall.","x":781.744966442953,"y":391.7315436241611,"imageId":null,"iconType":"building","tags":[],"factionId":null,"createdAt":1791999184098,"updatedAt":1791999184098,"version":1},{"id":"cxoo4yzdoFv_kzr29n6IQ","worldId":"WrAObMdV1iWydr79-9UFa","mapLayerId":"hOWCGejN0koMKyMLEcw4x","linkedMapLayerId":null,"name":"Pelican's Debt","description":"Osh Teague's salvage tug, 742 AL. Ninety metres of patched hull, two cutting arms, a galley that smells of solder. Mortgaged to Marrow Fane.","x":1199.2177314211212,"y":930.8996088657107,"imageId":null,"iconType":"custom","customType":"Ship","tags":[],"factionId":null,"createdAt":1791998977143,"updatedAt":1791998977143,"version":1},{"id":"fKieCBsNE-j7KAAlSK-Ct","worldId":"WrAObMdV1iWydr79-9UFa","mapLayerId":"hOWCGejN0koMKyMLEcw4x","linkedMapLayerId":null,"name":"The Obedient","description":"Compact Navy cutter commanded by Captain Rhee Salvador in 311 AL. By 742 AL a wreck tumbling in the deep Scree.","x":788.5267275097784,"y":520.2086049543677,"imageId":null,"iconType":"custom","customType":"Ship","tags":[],"factionId":null,"createdAt":1791998973713,"updatedAt":1791998973713,"version":1},{"id":"hResbre3KcGnLmFQ2q6c8","worldId":"WrAObMdV1iWydr79-9UFa","mapLayerId":"hOWCGejN0koMKyMLEcw4x","linkedMapLayerId":null,"name":"Ashgrave","description":"Small dark moon of Hesper. Prison colony in the Compact years.","x":1058.6701434159063,"y":390.61277705345503,"imageId":null,"iconType":"custom","customType":"Moon","tags":[],"factionId":null,"createdAt":1791998970179,"updatedAt":1791998970179,"version":1},{"id":"iSpcrsflS6fLkUv4OOyAG","worldId":"WrAObMdV1iWydr79-9UFa","mapLayerId":"hOWCGejN0koMKyMLEcw4x","linkedMapLayerId":null,"name":"The Scree","description":"Loose rubble belt between Cauld and Hesper. A graveyard of ships since the Unraveling; salvage territory in 742 AL.","x":808.6049543676663,"y":700.9126466753586,"imageId":null,"iconType":"custom","customType":"Asteroid belt","tags":[],"factionId":null,"createdAt":1791998966782,"updatedAt":1791998966782,"version":1},{"id":"k6mwWYvDFgoZfnd4D7B5m","worldId":"WrAObMdV1iWydr79-9UFa","mapLayerId":"_He5HO1KES1AkTNXs_Zls","linkedMapLayerId":null,"name":"The Choir","description":"A sounding anomaly under three hundred metres of ice at the heart of the Interdict Field. The Kin say the ice sings there.","x":1210.1694915254238,"y":571.3168187744459,"imageId":null,"iconType":"landmark","tags":[],"factionId":null,"createdAt":1791999242203,"updatedAt":1791999242203,"version":1},{"id":"lWTNZnvnj1j0yGTM-1ZaE","worldId":"WrAObMdV1iWydr79-9UFa","mapLayerId":"_He5HO1KES1AkTNXs_Zls","linkedMapLayerId":null,"name":"Shaft Twelve","description":"Deepest working shaft in the quadrant, closed after the strike of 310 AL.","x":638.8526727509778,"y":419.8174706649283,"imageId":null,"iconType":"landmark","tags":[],"factionId":null,"createdAt":1791999239210,"updatedAt":1791999239210,"version":1},{"id":"mGxbTHrLW4jI6oKhIx_7e","worldId":"WrAObMdV1iWydr79-9UFa","mapLayerId":"K5iWEt8U1PyOOet3iDqHG","linkedMapLayerId":null,"name":"Deck Nine","description":"The sleeper hold: four thousand berths in forty rows. Separable as a lander in the original yard specification \u2014 never exercised.","x":1359.03355704698,"y":484.51006711409394,"imageId":null,"iconType":"building","tags":[],"factionId":null,"createdAt":1791999193621,"updatedAt":1791999193621,"version":1},{"id":"r20QyZehf6cV2DUpulEvE","worldId":"WrAObMdV1iWydr79-9UFa","mapLayerId":"_He5HO1KES1AkTNXs_Zls","linkedMapLayerId":null,"name":"Landing Field","description":"Gallows Town's pad: ice graded flat and sprayed black so landers can see it.","x":558.5397653194264,"y":1020.3389830508476,"imageId":null,"iconType":"landmark","tags":[],"factionId":null,"createdAt":1791999236118,"updatedAt":1791999236118,"version":1},{"id":"rebp6zTC03AHNl06A4zti","worldId":"WrAObMdV1iWydr79-9UFa","mapLayerId":"_He5HO1KES1AkTNXs_Zls","linkedMapLayerId":null,"name":"Gallows Town","description":"Mining town of the Ninefold ice works, named for the drill gantries. Twelve thousand people in 311 AL. Empty by 742 AL but for wind and the Kin who come back to bury their dead.","x":379.66101694915255,"y":960.1043024771839,"imageId":null,"iconType":"town","tags":[],"factionId":null,"createdAt":1791999229972,"updatedAt":1791999229972,"version":1},{"id":"rnL8k-2Cu_3nYx2WGEzBz","worldId":"WrAObMdV1iWydr79-9UFa","mapLayerId":"hOWCGejN0koMKyMLEcw4x","linkedMapLayerId":null,"name":"Hesper","description":"Banded gas giant, the system's anchor. Helium skimming in the Compact years. Storms you can see from the station windows.","x":1409.1264667535854,"y":761.1473272490222,"imageId":null,"iconType":"custom","customType":"Gas giant","tags":[],"factionId":null,"createdAt":1791998959847,"updatedAt":1791998959847,"version":1},{"id":"tGmZT6VoeOcN4MCQoJa_s","worldId":"WrAObMdV1iWydr79-9UFa","mapLayerId":"hOWCGejN0koMKyMLEcw4x","linkedMapLayerId":null,"name":"Cauld","description":"Red dwarf. Dim, old, flare-prone. Everything in the Reach is a little cold.","x":229.98696219035205,"y":700.9126466753586,"imageId":null,"iconType":"custom","customType":"Star","tags":[],"factionId":null,"createdAt":1791998963228,"updatedAt":1791998963228,"version":1},{"id":"zcFaDeue-UWwkd5SwOmmb","worldId":"WrAObMdV1iWydr79-9UFa","mapLayerId":"hOWCGejN0koMKyMLEcw4x","linkedMapLayerId":"K5iWEt8U1PyOOet3iDqHG","name":"Tolland Orbit","description":"High orbit over Hesper where the Mercy of Tolland parked at Landfall and never left. By 311 AL the hull is the core of Tolland Station, capital of the Compact; by 742 AL it is the Hulk, a derelict full of scavengers.","x":1109.7783572359845,"y":861.5384615384615,"imageId":null,"iconType":"custom","customType":"Orbital station","tags":[],"factionId":null,"createdAt":1791998953023,"updatedAt":1791999052924,"version":2}],"characters":[{"id":"0O4hn5qD0gGcfRwtJRZqF","worldId":"WrAObMdV1iWydr79-9UFa","name":"Dace Hollin","aliases":[],"description":"Corporal of the Mercy's security watch. Kesh's man. Not cruel, which is worse: he does what he is told and sleeps afterwards.","portraitImageId":null,"tags":[],"isAlive":true,"color":null,"birthDate":null,"version":1,"createdAt":1791998852231,"updatedAt":1791998852231},{"id":"9F1iTe9tMJzcB_fkFlO93","worldId":"WrAObMdV1iWydr79-9UFa","name":"Saba Nkemelu","aliases":[],"description":"Pilot of the rival salvage cutter Sixpence. Osh's old partner and older lover. Knows the Scree better than anyone alive.","portraitImageId":null,"tags":[],"isAlive":true,"color":null,"birthDate":null,"version":1,"createdAt":1791998859287,"updatedAt":1791998859287},{"id":"AmSjCMUkCLaGXCDm-AB2o","worldId":"WrAObMdV1iWydr79-9UFa","name":"Sefa Lund","aliases":[],"description":"Ship's physician. Keeps the consumables model: air, water, reaction mass, bodies. Brilliant, exhausted, and the first to say the number out loud.","portraitImageId":null,"tags":[],"isAlive":true,"color":null,"birthDate":null,"version":1,"createdAt":1791998851664,"updatedAt":1791998851664},{"id":"Em986PAmamkpIkk5l0tev","worldId":"WrAObMdV1iWydr79-9UFa","name":"Rhee Salvador","aliases":[],"description":"Captain of the Compact Navy cutter Obedient. Precise, loyal, tired. The order to fire on Ninefold will come to her.","portraitImageId":null,"tags":[],"isAlive":true,"color":null,"birthDate":null,"version":1,"createdAt":1791998856087,"updatedAt":1791998856087},{"id":"Er9sM6SWRQkV5X6lhRZm5","worldId":"WrAObMdV1iWydr79-9UFa","name":"Brother Lio","aliases":[],"description":"Last priest of the Kesh Faith on the Hulk. Drinks. Tells the old story of Varga the Opener to anyone who'll buy him the next one.","portraitImageId":null,"tags":[],"isAlive":true,"color":null,"birthDate":null,"version":1,"createdAt":1791998859920,"updatedAt":1791998859920},{"id":"ROPxwJaWAjd8IneEw1TTo","worldId":"WrAObMdV1iWydr79-9UFa","name":"Hal Oduya","aliases":[],"description":"Archivist Prime of the Hall of Muster. Neve's teacher. Gentle, careful, frightened of the right things. Knows more than he says and less than he fears.","portraitImageId":null,"tags":[],"isAlive":true,"color":null,"birthDate":null,"version":1,"createdAt":1791998854148,"updatedAt":1791998854148},{"id":"Siy2D1Sem0I7mSho9bIsU","worldId":"WrAObMdV1iWydr79-9UFa","name":"Isidor Kesh-Amaury","aliases":[],"description":"Warden-General of the Compact, descendant of Aurel Kesh. Wears the Key of Office on a chain. Wants the Tricentennial to be the day the Ninefold strike ends.","portraitImageId":null,"tags":[],"isAlive":true,"color":null,"birthDate":null,"version":1,"createdAt":1791998854794,"updatedAt":1791998854794},{"id":"UN3WBJLGdoUYKfMunkOYS","worldId":"WrAObMdV1iWydr79-9UFa","name":"Ines Oyelaran","aliases":[],"description":"Captain of the Mercy of Tolland, Tamsin's mother. Dies in medbay in the first days of the deceleration burn, telling Ilse to remember who the ship belongs to.","portraitImageId":null,"tags":[],"isAlive":true,"color":null,"birthDate":null,"version":1,"createdAt":1791998850402,"updatedAt":1791998850402},{"id":"UmIFHig8VkkgpbF8ao84U","worldId":"WrAObMdV1iWydr79-9UFa","name":"Ilse Varga","aliases":[],"description":"Warden-engineer of Deck Nine, the sleeper hold of the generation hauler Mercy of Tolland. Forty-one, coolant-scarred lungs, a laugh like a dropped wrench. Carries the torque key that opens the manual locks of the cold rows.","portraitImageId":null,"tags":[],"isAlive":true,"color":null,"birthDate":{"year":-40,"month":6,"day":9},"version":2,"createdAt":1791998273138,"updatedAt":1792005041877,"nameChanges":[],"aliasesFrom":[]},{"id":"WIHijinlYh_XtLLwh55Wj","worldId":"WrAObMdV1iWydr79-9UFa","name":"Mother Calloway","aliases":[],"description":"Elder of the Ninefold Kin on Tolland Station. Keeps the songs, including the one about the deck that fell.","portraitImageId":null,"tags":[],"isAlive":true,"color":null,"birthDate":null,"version":1,"createdAt":1791998856747,"updatedAt":1791998856747},{"id":"XaxoK6B9LtTUELmk1nZyO","worldId":"WrAObMdV1iWydr79-9UFa","name":"Tamsin Oyelaran","aliases":[],"description":"Junior navigator of the Mercy, nineteen, the dead captain's daughter and Ilse's apprentice on Deck Nine. Narrows her eyes at instruments as if they lie. Becomes the first Warden of the Compact and keeps its secret in cipher.","portraitImageId":null,"tags":[],"isAlive":true,"color":null,"birthDate":{"year":-18,"month":9,"day":21},"version":2,"createdAt":1791998849234,"updatedAt":1792005047994,"nameChanges":[],"aliasesFrom":[]},{"id":"YTdh3UFvZumhwAMKsW3EX","worldId":"WrAObMdV1iWydr79-9UFa","name":"Neve Castellan","aliases":[],"description":"Junior archivist at the Hall of Muster on Tolland Station, 311 AL. Twenty-eight, ink under her nails, a good eye for a forged hand. Charged with restoring the Muster Roll for the Tricentennial.","portraitImageId":null,"tags":[],"isAlive":true,"color":null,"birthDate":{"year":283,"month":4,"day":2},"version":2,"createdAt":1791998853526,"updatedAt":1792005060160,"nameChanges":[],"aliasesFrom":[]},{"id":"_IRYdIL6_P3jdFlS5mLgo","worldId":"WrAObMdV1iWydr79-9UFa","name":"Jory Mbeki","aliases":[],"description":"Organiser for the Ninefold Ice Union, sent up the well to Tolland Station to negotiate. Ice-burned hands, a miner's cough, a terrible singing voice he uses anyway.","portraitImageId":null,"tags":[],"isAlive":true,"color":null,"birthDate":{"year":280,"month":8,"day":17},"version":2,"createdAt":1791998855454,"updatedAt":1792005066243,"nameChanges":[],"aliasesFrom":[]},{"id":"fW9Cc6WRLW1-JAdKCif6W","worldId":"WrAObMdV1iWydr79-9UFa","name":"Ama Okafor","aliases":[],"description":"Bram Okafor's daughter. Put into the cold at seven, thirty-three years before Landfall, in a berth left empty when the mason Okonkwo's pod failed: Row Thirty-One, berth twelve. Asleep for the whole of this book until its last page.","portraitImageId":null,"tags":[],"isAlive":true,"color":null,"birthDate":{"year":-39,"month":3,"day":14},"version":2,"createdAt":1791998852894,"updatedAt":1792005035760,"nameChanges":[],"aliasesFrom":[]},{"id":"guiFYjTdkRUB3YoIW0Qu-","worldId":"WrAObMdV1iWydr79-9UFa","name":"Aurel Kesh","aliases":[],"description":"First Officer, then Captain, of the Mercy of Tolland. Lean, grey-bearded, trusted on sight. Believes in the arithmetic. History will call him the Father of the Compact.","portraitImageId":null,"tags":[],"isAlive":true,"color":null,"birthDate":{"year":-40,"month":1,"day":3},"version":2,"createdAt":1791998849822,"updatedAt":1792005054076,"nameChanges":[],"aliasesFrom":[]},{"id":"hu3l45nfulGLJ4dWGQo1R","worldId":"WrAObMdV1iWydr79-9UFa","name":"Oshun Teague","aliases":[],"description":"Called Osh. Captain and owner, on paper, of the salvage tug Pelican's Debt, 742 AL. Forty-six, unlucky with money and lucky with vacuum. Owes Marrow Fane more than the tug is worth.","portraitImageId":null,"tags":[],"isAlive":true,"color":null,"birthDate":{"year":697,"month":2,"day":11},"version":2,"createdAt":1791998857378,"updatedAt":1792005072359,"nameChanges":[],"aliasesFrom":[]},{"id":"mB_jsvgRGSkGrc-Vnd3FH","worldId":"WrAObMdV1iWydr79-9UFa","name":"Marrow Fane","aliases":[],"description":"The Assessor: debt-lord of the Hulk, who keeps his Counting House on the old bridge of Tolland Station. Soft-voiced, collector of relics, owner of everyone's paper.","portraitImageId":null,"tags":[],"isAlive":true,"color":null,"birthDate":null,"version":1,"createdAt":1791998858667,"updatedAt":1791998858667},{"id":"mW6GvLSWxYDcMHSZHlFlY","worldId":"WrAObMdV1iWydr79-9UFa","name":"Kit Aranda","aliases":[],"description":"Osh's rigger, seventeen, born in the dead mining town on Ninefold. Kin by blood. Says the Names every night out of a falling-apart paper book.","portraitImageId":null,"tags":[],"isAlive":true,"color":null,"birthDate":{"year":725,"month":10,"day":28},"version":2,"createdAt":1791998858029,"updatedAt":1792005078442,"nameChanges":[],"aliasesFrom":[]},{"id":"rF9q0I-cFStCoUa92LlLq","worldId":"WrAObMdV1iWydr79-9UFa","name":"Bram Okafor","aliases":[],"description":"Quartermaster of the Mercy. Big, slow-spoken, keeps the paper Muster Roll in his own hand because he does not trust anything with a battery. His daughter Ama sleeps on Deck Nine.","portraitImageId":null,"tags":[],"isAlive":true,"color":null,"birthDate":null,"version":1,"createdAt":1791998851044,"updatedAt":1791998851044}],"items":[{"id":"7Qd3d0Xlv0W1nhsd_Iyra","imageId":null,"worldId":"WrAObMdV1iWydr79-9UFa","name":"The Tolland Charter","description":"The colony charter of the Tolland Company, sealed in a steel strongbox in the quartermaster's store. Names the sleepers as the shareholders of the colony and the crew as their indentured servants.","iconType":"","tags":[],"version":1},{"id":"H6CWn2saH8BavVTd45MJt","imageId":null,"worldId":"WrAObMdV1iWydr79-9UFa","name":"Ilse's Letter","description":"Four pages written in grease pencil on the back of a coolant schedule, left at the drop controls of Deck Nine.","iconType":"","tags":[],"version":1},{"id":"Q_DoL-UpW5ZUBmO9bwT-v","imageId":null,"worldId":"WrAObMdV1iWydr79-9UFa","name":"The Torque Key","description":"A torque wrench as long as a forearm, head machined to the manual lock-bolts of Deck Nine; handle wrapped in pale composite every warden calls bone. Twelve wardens' initials scratched in the collar, the last I.V. Becomes the Compact's Key of Office; ends as a trophy on Marrow Fane's wall.","iconType":"","tags":[],"version":1},{"id":"YwiMeYg1lXIoDRGJykqE7","imageId":null,"worldId":"WrAObMdV1iWydr79-9UFa","name":"The Muster Roll","description":"The paper register of the four thousand sleepers, row by row, berth by berth, in Quartermaster Sato's hand at the launch, signed at the foot of each row by every quartermaster since; the last of them Bram Okafor, who wrote his daughter in over a dead man's line. Scorched in the fire in the stores. Kept under glass in the Hall of Muster as the Roll of the Four Thousand. The First Warden's iron-gall pinpricks in its margins hold a cipher.","iconType":"","tags":[],"version":2,"isCollective":false},{"id":"bI9Y1FNY21qm9DDy_Lcw6","imageId":null,"worldId":"WrAObMdV1iWydr79-9UFa","name":"Obedient Flight Recorder","description":"The armoured black box of the Compact cutter Obedient. Holds Captain Rhee Salvador's fire-control log for the first day of 311 AL.","iconType":"","tags":[],"version":1},{"id":"bu1kJTRuR9m937p4WCaCe","imageId":null,"worldId":"WrAObMdV1iWydr79-9UFa","name":"The Names","description":"A thin sheaf of heavy grey paper sewn into red Union cloth: Rows Twenty-Eight to Thirty-Four of a much older register, names with ages, trades and berth numbers, with tiny pinholes in the margins. The Kin prayer book Kit Aranda reads from every night.","iconType":"","tags":[],"version":1}],"characterSnapshots":[{"worldId":"WrAObMdV1iWydr79-9UFa","characterId":"ROPxwJaWAjd8IneEw1TTo","eventId":"rrxi-voBf0Ncy5LcIy8O0","isAlive":true,"currentLocationMarkerId":"HbnBXM2OZ-EqHSiiuSTVc","currentMapLayerId":"K5iWEt8U1PyOOet3iDqHG","inventoryItemIds":[],"inventoryNotes":"","statusNotes":"","travelModeId":null,"id":"-IEoS1-GTqw7fiKsOwBAI","sortKey":14.000002,"createdAt":1792001872405,"updatedAt":1792001872405,"version":1},{"worldId":"WrAObMdV1iWydr79-9UFa","characterId":"XaxoK6B9LtTUELmk1nZyO","eventId":"3R3VdzgkT77XhYhxEp_aP","isAlive":true,"currentLocationMarkerId":"4jf9axgqen2qDyUdWny3I","currentMapLayerId":"K5iWEt8U1PyOOet3iDqHG","inventoryItemIds":["YwiMeYg1lXIoDRGJykqE7"],"inventoryNotes":"","statusNotes":"","travelModeId":null,"id":"-g0nZ-BMSSmC8NUC3IVRG","sortKey":13.000002,"createdAt":1792001850656,"updatedAt":1792001850887,"version":2},{"worldId":"WrAObMdV1iWydr79-9UFa","characterId":"_IRYdIL6_P3jdFlS5mLgo","eventId":"-xco6-C-HrTUTl2ffNwzy","isAlive":true,"currentLocationMarkerId":"V6KUDzVSv4lmRZMLasSVx","currentMapLayerId":"K5iWEt8U1PyOOet3iDqHG","inventoryItemIds":[],"inventoryNotes":"","statusNotes":"","travelModeId":null,"id":"1k7F4vjdI9DRoXfEhzhXA","sortKey":8.000002,"createdAt":1792001736138,"updatedAt":1792001736138,"version":1},{"worldId":"WrAObMdV1iWydr79-9UFa","characterId":"rF9q0I-cFStCoUa92LlLq","eventId":"kuM2LYYNTD_swnVMU0ViA","isAlive":true,"currentLocationMarkerId":"KEB1yuj8GwIjzG_FwfaPN","currentMapLayerId":"K5iWEt8U1PyOOet3iDqHG","inventoryItemIds":[],"inventoryNotes":"","statusNotes":"","travelModeId":null,"id":"1xTOBUXzMgek2jfhvI1iP","sortKey":4.000001,"createdAt":1792002236195,"updatedAt":1792002236195,"version":1},{"worldId":"WrAObMdV1iWydr79-9UFa","characterId":"ROPxwJaWAjd8IneEw1TTo","eventId":"aPPcTYkeKSmaIe0ROn2nf","isAlive":true,"currentLocationMarkerId":"FjkJFggKTvQonCgHoICS1","currentMapLayerId":"K5iWEt8U1PyOOet3iDqHG","inventoryItemIds":[],"inventoryNotes":"","statusNotes":"","travelModeId":null,"id":"2OWmoLI3V1aBpXZtiI4Vw","sortKey":17.000002,"createdAt":1792001942554,"updatedAt":1792001942554,"version":1},{"worldId":"WrAObMdV1iWydr79-9UFa","characterId":"_IRYdIL6_P3jdFlS5mLgo","eventId":"qUD2DOuXDhUoFZhGoX9ml","isAlive":true,"currentLocationMarkerId":"4jf9axgqen2qDyUdWny3I","currentMapLayerId":"K5iWEt8U1PyOOet3iDqHG","inventoryItemIds":[],"inventoryNotes":"","statusNotes":"","travelModeId":null,"id":"2OvOxh1BvURJ0-Ew5ZvN8","sortKey":2.000002,"createdAt":1792001353803,"updatedAt":1792001353803,"version":1},{"worldId":"WrAObMdV1iWydr79-9UFa","characterId":"YTdh3UFvZumhwAMKsW3EX","eventId":"PT3XmRi-JWp5KBrckDnPd","isAlive":true,"currentLocationMarkerId":"V6KUDzVSv4lmRZMLasSVx","currentMapLayerId":"K5iWEt8U1PyOOet3iDqHG","inventoryItemIds":[],"inventoryNotes":"","statusNotes":"","travelModeId":null,"id":"4VLloJ-Irpr1-Y1BmeQof","sortKey":17.000001,"createdAt":1792002309480,"updatedAt":1792002309480,"version":1},{"worldId":"WrAObMdV1iWydr79-9UFa","characterId":"Er9sM6SWRQkV5X6lhRZm5","eventId":"54os9ueXEVay1bGczw7FV","isAlive":true,"currentLocationMarkerId":"3UHWEEdv1Nz8fLrFRstqt","currentMapLayerId":"K5iWEt8U1PyOOet3iDqHG","inventoryItemIds":[],"inventoryNotes":"","statusNotes":"","travelModeId":null,"id":"8moQ2hES82IhuAeBUmVPT","sortKey":12.000002,"createdAt":1792001829271,"updatedAt":1792001829271,"version":1},{"worldId":"WrAObMdV1iWydr79-9UFa","characterId":"Siy2D1Sem0I7mSho9bIsU","eventId":"A-FY7Nsk-WNvo5oEcOFBQ","isAlive":true,"currentLocationMarkerId":"X-RTBLHErhKR9ZtgUT5E5","currentMapLayerId":"K5iWEt8U1PyOOet3iDqHG","inventoryItemIds":[],"inventoryNotes":"","statusNotes":"","travelModeId":null,"id":"8xoKDQgPkrGxNITaESOat","sortKey":5.000002,"createdAt":1792001671210,"updat